# Small world

A minimal hyper-markdown tree that exercises most of HMD-0001. Every link here
is a bare name resolved by the spine walk, because this file sits at the
namespace root and the folder notes it points at are one level down.

## Map

- [[specs]] — the specification namespace, itself split by domain
- [[shared]] — cards that more than one domain depends on
- [[glossary]] — one term per card
- [[logging]] — the general logging rules

Each of the first three resolves to a **folder note**: `[[specs]]` names a
directory, so it binds to `specs/index.hmd`.

## What is deliberately absent

This file never writes `[[tokens]]`. Two cards claim that name —
`shared/tokens.hmd` and `specs/auth/tokens.hmd` — and neither is on this file's
spine, so the bare form would reach phase 3, match both, and raise HMD002. The
cards that need both import them under distinct names instead; see
[[invoices]].
